# .superpowers/plans/ and .superpowers/specs/ are the design record and stay
# tracked. .superpowers/sdd/ is per-run agent scratch (briefs, reports, diffs,
# ledger), not part of that record, so it is ignored explicitly here rather
# than relying only on the nested (and itself untracked) .superpowers/sdd/.gitignore.
.superpowers/sdd/
